# Module arguments in the local analysis of §13.8

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, *The Classification of Quasithin Groups*, combined
manuscript of 1 March 2004, printed pp.947–948, Lemmas 13.8.4–6.

The permutation-module assertion of 13.8.4(5) is established for the literal
source section and its compatible action. The shared module also supplies
K₂ = O²(C_H(V₂)), U₂ = ⟨V^{K₂}⟩, and proved subgroup steps for 13.8.5–6.
The full recognition and representation-theoretic conclusions of 13.8.5–6
remain to be assembled here.
-/
